{
  "name": "skill-progression",
  "description": "Chapter 3: Hire driller, assign drilling skill, and verify skill progression under continuous work with no rest building (#549: real completions include genuine collapse/rest cost). #1313: with no living quarters the lone driller's collapse crashes wellBeing to its floor and the worker revolt ends the level at tick 301 -- the mine freezes there, so the run no longer reaches the 700-tick budget or the 1 (blasting) + 3 (driving.excavator) = 4 proficiency it used to; it stops at driving.excavator level 2 (total 3), reached at tick 178. Everything after the revolt asserts the frozen state.",
